# Uleguerand - Dominion Op #10 (abyssea 110, op 583): a level 99 Warrior in Abyssea - Uleguerand; the op's target
# Hoarmite (26 placed spawns, the first 17813665). The next op (#11, Ermit_Imp) and Altepa's and Grauberg's #10 accepted
# (a GM), this op available: a Hoarmite killed: no section: nothing. This op accepted (a GM; activeDominionOp stays 0,
# which dominionOnMobDeath does not read): a Hoarmite killed: dominionOnMobDeath(583): Quest[8][110]Prog 1
# (FOV_DEFEATED_TARGET 1 of 5). The next op's Ermit_Imp killed: Quest[8][111]Prog 1 (its own count), this op's
# unchanged. Prog 4 (a GM): one more: Prog 5 (5 of 5); another: the count is full (numDefeated < 5 is false): nothing.
# Completed (Prog 0, as completeDominionOp leaves it; a GM): another killed: no section: nothing.
# Abyssea - Uleguerand's IDs.lua names no mob, so each kill names its mob by id (kill #<id>). Perfect Dodge, Invincible
# and Elemental Sforzo (GM effects) keep the chars alive through the kills (the Abyssea mobs aggro and link).
lists AbysseaUleguerand/Hoarmite/onMobDeath AbysseaUleguerand/Ermit_Imp/onMobDeath
char zone=AbysseaUleguerand pos=-240,-40,-520 job=WAR lvl=99
login
effect 49                               # a GM: Perfect Dodge (melee hits evaded)
effect 50                               # a GM: Invincible (no physical damage)
effect 522                              # a GM: Elemental Sforzo (no magic damage)
quest Abyssea.DominionOp11Uleguerand accepted # a GM: the next op
quest Abyssea.DominionOp10Altepa accepted # a GM: Altepa's #10
quest Abyssea.DominionOp10Grauberg accepted # a GM: Grauberg's #10
kill #17813665                          # available: nothing
quest Abyssea.DominionOp10Uleguerand accepted # a GM
kill #17813666                          # accepted: Prog 1
kill #17813545                          # Ermit_Imp: Quest[8][111]Prog 1
charvar Quest[8][110]Prog 4             # a GM
kill #17813667                          # Prog 5
kill #17813668                          # full: nothing
quest Abyssea.DominionOp10Uleguerand completed # a GM
charvar Quest[8][110]Prog 0             # a GM
kill #17813669                          # completed: nothing
